    <!--
      Localization starter pass: MainMenuScreen — the first screen every player sees — is fully
      extracted here as the reference pattern (stringResource(R.string.x) instead of a raw Kotlin
      literal), with a real second locale (values-es/strings.xml) to prove resource switching
      actually works end-to-end, not just that a strings.xml file exists. The other ~190 Text()
      call sites across the 11 game screens and Settings/Stats are NOT yet extracted — see
      README.md's Depth/localization notes for the honest scope of what remains. Extracting the
      rest follows this exact same mechanical pattern per screen; there is no infrastructure
      blocker left, only the repetitive work of doing it screen by screen.
    -->

